STEP Bible

Data from STEP Bible (https://www.STEPBible.org), Tyndale House, Cambridge,
CC BY 4.0: https://github.com/STEPBible/STEPBible-Data. Lemma assignments
derived from its TAHOT and TAGNT are carried in
ontology/entities/entities.jsonl, each credited in its own record; its
lexicons and TIPNR are fetched from that repository, not redistributed here.

